# Double stops: notes held together are bowed together on adjacent strings.
# A moving line over a held open D, then sustained and short chords.
tempo 60
0 poly on
0 dyn 0.5
0 vib 0.5
0 on D3 70              # open D, held under the line on the A string
0 note A3 1.05 70
1 note B3 1.05 70
2 note C#4 1.05 70
3 note D4 1.9 80
3 off D3
5 note G2 1.9 70        # a sixth: open G, E3 on the D string
5 note E3 1.9 70
7 note A2 1.9 70        # a third: A2 on the C string, C3 on the G string
7 note C3 1.9 70
9 bow on
9 note G2 0.2 90        # short chords on the string: both notes in one stroke
9 note D3 0.2 90
9.5 note G2 0.2 90
9.5 note D3 0.2 90
10 note C3 0.2 90
10 note G3 0.2 90
